---
import PolicyPage from '../layouts/PolicyPage.astro';
import DataPath from '../components/legal/DataPath.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config.js';
---
<PolicyPage
  title="Sub-processors"
  description="Third parties involved in providing LoomConnect AI and loomconnect.com."
  summary="LoomConnect AI runs inside your own Salesforce org and connects to an AI provider you choose and contract with directly. LoomConnect does not receive your Salesforce data, so it uses no sub-processors for it."
>
  <DataPath />

  <h2>LoomConnect AI (the Salesforce package)</h2>
  <p>No LoomConnect sub-processor handles your Salesforce data or AI conversations. Your organisation, not LoomConnect, chooses and contracts with the providers below, so they are your processors, not ours.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Provider</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Contracted by</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Salesforce</td><td>Hosts your org and runs LoomConnect AI</td><td>You</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Anthropic or OpenAI</td><td>Generates AI responses, using your API key</td><td>You</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>loomconnect.com, support and billing</h2>
  <p>These providers handle the details you send us through this website, by email and when you buy a paid plan. We are the controller of this data.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Provider</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Location</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Cloudflare</td><td>Website hosting, security and cookie-free analytics</td><td>[TO CONFIRM]</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Salesforce</td><td>Our CRM: demo requests and support cases</td><td>[TO CONFIRM]</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Google</td><td>[Only if added] reCAPTCHA spam protection on forms</td><td>[TO CONFIRM]</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{site.legal.emailProvider}</td><td>Email</td><td>[TO CONFIRM]</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{site.legal.paymentProvider}</td><td>Payments for paid plans</td><td>[TO CONFIRM]</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>We'll update this page before adding a new sub-processor. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.email.privacy}`}>{site.email.privacy}</a></p>
</PolicyPage>
